(TALLY PRIME GOLDEN VOUCHERS:) '
(   - F4 \(Contra\)  : Cash deposited into Bank or Bank to Bank transfer.) '
(   - F5 \(Payment\) : Cheque or Cash paid to Sundry Creditors or Expense accounts.) '
(   - F6 \(Receipt\) : Payment received from Sundry Debtors.) '
(   - F8 \(Sales\)   : Goods or Services sold to customers \(Debit Debtor / Credit Sales\).) '
(   - F9 \(Purchase\): Goods purchased from vendors \(Debit Purchase / Credit Creditor\).) '
() '
(GST INVOICE RULES:) '
(   - Intra-State \(Same State\): CGST \(50%\) + SGST \(50%\) applied.) '
(   - Inter-State \(Other State\): IGST \(100%\) applied.) '
(   - HSN Code: Mandatory for goods, SAC code for services.) '
() '
(MONTH-END CLOSING CHECKLIST:) '
(   - 1. Bank Reconciliation Statement \(BRS\) with bank passbook.) '
(   - 2. Verify Sundry Debtors & Creditors balances.) '
(   - 3. Check Input Tax Credit \(ITC\) vs Output Tax Liability in GSTR-3B.) '

